  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "intro-1",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "Hands up for a peak, hands low for a valley.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro-2",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "A letter rides the rise and fall.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-A",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "Alpine Goat — that's A. Hooves on ground | steady little steps go round",
      "targetId": "A",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-B",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "Spot B: Boulder! A boulder is a very large rounded or broken piece of rock.",
      "targetId": "B",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-C",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "C brings Cliff. Cliff rises high | steep rock face against the sky",
      "targetId": "C",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-D",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "D? Douglas Fir! A Douglas fir is a tall evergreen tree with needle-like leaves and hanging cones.",
      "targetId": "D",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-E",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "Along the mountain trail, here is E with Edelweiss. Petals bright | flower colors catch the light",
      "targetId": "E",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-F",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "Falcon — that's F. It is a bird with feathers, wings, and a beak; it moves through its habitat by walking, hopping, swimming, or flying.",
      "targetId": "F",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-G",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "Spot G: Goat! Hooves on ground | steady little steps go round",
      "targetId": "G",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-H",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "H brings Hawk. It is a keen-eyed bird of prey with strong wings and grasping feet.",
      "targetId": "H",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-I",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "I? Icefall! An icefall is a steep, broken part of a glacier where the ice flows downhill.",
      "targetId": "I",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-J",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "Along the mountain trail, here is J with Jay. It is a bird with feathers, wings, and a beak; it moves through its habitat by walking, hopping, swimming, or flying.",
      "targetId": "J",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-K",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "Kestrel — that's K. Feather light | beak and wings come into sight",
      "targetId": "K",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-L",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "Spot L: Lynx! A lynx is a furry mammal that walks quietly and uses keen senses to explore its habitat.",
      "targetId": "L",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-3-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-3",
      "text": "Peaks up high—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-3-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-3",
      "text": "Valleys low—come sing with me!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-M",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "M brings Marmot. Small and quick | little feet go tick-tick-tick",
      "targetId": "M",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-N",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "N? Nest! A nest is a place birds build to hold eggs and chicks.",
      "targetId": "N",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-O",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "Along the mountain trail, here is O with Outcrop. It is a place where solid rock is exposed at the ground surface.",
      "targetId": "O",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-P",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "Pika — that's P. It is a small round-eared mountain mammal that lives among rocks.",
      "targetId": "P",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Q",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "Spot Q: Quail! Quail on the trail | ground bird with a little tail",
      "targetId": "Q",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-R",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "R brings Rope. It is a strong flexible length of twisted or braided fibers; children only identify climbing rope safely.",
      "targetId": "R",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-S",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "S? Summit! A summit is the highest point of a hill or mountain.",
      "targetId": "S",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-T",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "Along the mountain trail, here is T with Trail. It is a path people follow through outdoor places.",
      "targetId": "T",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-U",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "Upland Meadow — that's U. Sway and grow | plant finds light from down below",
      "targetId": "U",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-V",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "Spot V: Valley! A valley is low land between hills or mountains, often with water running through.",
      "targetId": "V",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-W",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "W brings Waterfall. Water falls tall | rushing sheet by rocky wall",
      "targetId": "W",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-X",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "X? Xeric Shrub! A xeric shrub is a woody plant adapted to dry conditions.",
      "targetId": "X",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-6-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-6",
      "text": "Peaks up high—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-6-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-6",
      "text": "Valleys low—come sing with me!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Y",
      "sectionId": "r1-y-z",
      "text": "Along the mountain trail, here is Y with Yellow Bell. Bloom in view | petals open fresh with dew",
      "targetId": "Y",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Z",
      "sectionId": "r1-y-z",
      "text": "Zigzag Trail — that's Z. It bends back and forth to climb a slope more gently.",
      "targetId": "Z",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-A",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "Spot A ... Alpine Goat! Tap two quiet hoof-beats with your fingers.",
      "targetId": "A",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-B",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "Remember B ... Boulder! Trace the land or ice shape in the air.",
      "targetId": "B",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-C",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "C? ... Cliff! Trace its shape in the air from a safe viewing spot.",
      "targetId": "C",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-D",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "Find D ... Douglas Fir! Reach both hands up like branches.",
      "targetId": "D",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-E",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "Spot E ... Edelweiss! Open both hands like a flower.",
      "targetId": "E",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-F",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "Remember F ... Falcon! Lift two gentle wings, then hold still.",
      "targetId": "F",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
